---
description: "Python type safety — strict mypy, protocols, minimal Any"
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Read [`PYTHON_TYPE_SAFETY.md`](../../PYTHON_TYPE_SAFETY.md) and [`rules/common/python-types.md`](../../rules/common/python-types.md).

- Strict mypy; `no_implicit_optional = true`
- Aliases in `app/types.py`; protocols in `app/services/ports.py`
- No `**kwargs: Any`; use keyword-only overrides
- Verify: `uv run mypy app scripts tests`